{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-btitle",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -700,
   "y": -360,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "# Gemma 4 E4B — one decoder layer  \nDrawn for a sliding layer (L0); full layers differ only in head size and RoPE (right). Grey bars = tensors (0.05 px/channel, long ones clipped), boxes = operations with their weights. Sandwich norms around attention and FFN, then the per-layer-embedding block, then × a learned layer scalar."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-blegend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 900,
   "y": -360,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "**Sliding** (35 layers): 8 q / 2 kv heads × 256, window 512, RoPE θ 10,000.    \n**Full** (7: L5, L11, L17, L23, L29, L35, L41): 8 q / 2 kv heads × 512, causal over everything, p-RoPE θ 1,000,000 on 25% of dims.    \n**KV-shared** (L24–41): the k / v columns are skipped (orange)."
  },
  {
   "id": "xin1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -64,
   "y": -100,
   "width": 128,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 170,
   "y": -110,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 2560]  residual stream in`"
  },
  {
   "id": "n13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": -46,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**input norm** — RMSNorm",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "h4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -64,
