   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "→ KV cache",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "kvshared",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1500,
   "y": 304,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 401,
   "text": "**KV-shared layers (L24–41)** skip the k and v columns entirely: attention reads the K/V that L22 (sliding) or L23 (full) computed for the same tokens.  \n\nTheir k/v weights (55.1M in total) are in the checkpoint but never loaded.",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "att",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": 688,
   "width": 1340,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**attention** — 8 query heads share 2 KV heads (4:1 GQA), scale 1 (q, k already normed)    \nsliding: causal window 512 · full: causal over all tokens",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "ao21",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -51,
